# Working state of the stage-2 run, not its record.
#
# `_logs/` is `Tee-Object` output and is UTF-16; the durable per-cell record is the committed
# `s4_build_*.json`, `s4_sizing.json` and the README, each of which carries the same figures in a
# form a later reader can actually parse.
_logs/
# `_boot/` holds one JSON per boot-RSS repeat — three per artifact, a dozen-odd files whose only
# consumer is `s4_sizing.py`, which folds the medians and every raw repeat into `s4_sizing.json`.
_boot/
